cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "ResourceAwareLean"
version: 0.1.0
license: Apache-2.0
type: software
abstract: >-
  Resource-aware textbook algorithms in Lean 4: algorithms written once as
  free programs over an operation signature, interpreted under independently
  varying semantic and cost models, with proved model-independence, ordered
  operation traces, and asymptotic bounds.
authors:
  - name: "Jiyuan (Chai Yuen) Ji"
  - name: "Daya Kumaran"
  - name: "James Needham"
  - name: "Lechen Wang"
